<title>UK: Banco Itau sets $100 mln 3-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Itau sets $100 mln 3-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager - Union Bank of Switzerland</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO ITAU</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    28.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    28.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.45	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD  **+160-175 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CI</p>
<p> GOV LAW    UK	  HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
